creatures:
- name: Hell Hound
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 15  
      **Hit Points** 58 (rollable(dice=9d8 + 18,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** 50 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Initiative) (11)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Perception Check)  
      **Damage Immunities** fire  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 15  
      **Languages** understands Infernal but can't speak  
      **Challenge** 3 (700 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      ***Pack Tactics.*** The hound has ***Advantage*** on an attack roll against a creature if at least one of the hound's allies is within 5 feet of the creature and the ally doesn't have the ***Incapacitated*** condition.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The hound makes two Bite attacks.

      ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d8+3,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=1d6,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Fire damage.

      ***Fire Breath (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Fire Breath])).*** *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 12, each creature in a 15-foot ***Cone***. *Failure:* rollable(dice=5d6,dicelabel=Damage [Fire Breath]) Fire damage. *Success:* Half damage.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
